{"id": "t109-001", "text": "so archie's got his interview at the council on thursday at 2pm um no sorry 2:30 and he's really nervous about the presentation bit he has to do ten minutes on community engagement and he hates public speaking his girlfriend layla's been making him practise in front of the cat every night remind me to text him good luck thursday morning", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "archie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the council", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates public speaking", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "layla", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "thursday morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
